ef 17592186045417] [17592186572080 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "c878ff99-495e-5613-8683-22e308482f13" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572150 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186572027 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572150 #edb/ref 1069 "q-48848" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572150 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572150 #edb/ref 1071 "Find the slope of the tangent to the curve $y=\\sqrt{3{x}^{2}+24}$ at the point where $x=-2.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572150 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "87ece511-fd94-56a1-8fa2-055336c9156b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572150 #edb/ref 1074 "To find the slope at a given point, we have to find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ at that point.\n\nWe use the chain rule in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}.\n$$\n\nLet $u=3{x}^{2}+24.$ Then $y=\\sqrt{u}.$ Differentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=6x.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the two together gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}}\\cdot 6x \\\\  & =\\frac{3x}{\\sqrt{3{x}^{2}+24}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting  $x=-2,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=-2} & ={(\\frac{3x}{\\sqrt{3{x}^{2}+24}})|}_{x=-2} \\\\  & =\\frac{(-6)}{\\sqrt{3(-2)^{2}+24}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{6}{6} \\\\  & =-1\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572161 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186572074 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572161 #edb/ref 1069 "q-71951" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572161 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572161 #edb/ref 1071 "Given that $f(x)={({x}^{4}-2{x}^{3})}^{2},$ find ${f}^{′}(x).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572161 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "9d6e7296-3732-5370-89a1-2dbb983a355c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572161 #edb/ref 1074 "Let $g(x)={x}^{4}-2{x}^{3}$ and $f(g(x))=g(x)^{2}.$ \n\nDifferentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(g(x)) & =({g}^{2})^{′}=2g, \\\\ {g}^{′}(x) & =({x}^{4}-2{x}^{3})^{′}=4{x}^{3}-6{x}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, using the chain rule, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & ={f}^{′}(g(x))\\cdot {g}^{′}(x) \\\\  & =2g\\cdot (4{x}^{3}-6{x}^{2}) \\\\  & =2({x}^{4}-2{x}^{3})(4{x}^{3}-6{x}^{2}).\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572194 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186572080 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572194 #edb/ref 1069 "q-107298" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572194 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572194 #edb/ref 1071 "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=-\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{x-{x}^{2}}}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572194 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "e5c85892-5c29-5ec5-80d2-d47ed89d83b9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572194 #edb/ref 1074 "Let $g(x)=x-{x}^{2}$ and $f(g(x))=-\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{g}}=-4{g}^{-1/2}.$ \n\nDifferentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(g(x)) & =-4({g}^{-1/2})^{′}=4\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}{g}^{-3/2}=\\frac{2}{{g}^{3/2}}, \\\\ {g}^{′}(x) & =(x-{x}^{2})^{′}=1-2x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, using the chain rule, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & ={f}^{′}(g(x))\\cdot {g}^{′}(x) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{{g}^{3/2}}\\cdot (1-2x) \\\\  & =\\frac{2-4x}{\\sqrt{(x-{x}^{2})^{3}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572224 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186572226 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572224 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "3e13e019-bb52-5d8f-95f9-937af8f29b8f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572224 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186572150 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572225 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "3f12b7e4-e0e1-5d0d-aa45-c42523632b41" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572225 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186572194 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572226 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186572225 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572226 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "439bf3c9-9c86-5ea1-bcba-ed795ff54c05" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186572226 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186572161 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
